QC iteration 1 found 13 defects; all are fixed:
  T053  Principle VII — the security limitation record stated two falsehoods and
        its reversal trigger had fired. Corrected, and a non-gating audit step
        added so its scope decision is true rather than aspirational.
  T054  FR-042 — the scoping control was never on screen in the empty-filter
        state, so a coordinator could only leave the scope by reloading.
  T055  FR-029 — the row-level stale mark was unimplemented.
  T056  FR-051 — bounded forms were not announced as words.
  T057  The E2E seed truncated the shared development database, breaking
        src/model's forecast tier. It now owns a separate database.
  T058-T064  Test-coverage and provenance gaps, including a per-figure reference
        class sourced from schema_constants rather than the run it describes.
  T065  This marker's own figures.

